#: ../developer/configuration.md ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:3
msgid ""
"Configure the gateway in Admin, under **Settings**, **Providers** and "
"**Routing**. Application configuration is stored in PostgreSQL; the "
"gateway reads no model, routing, alert, distribution or branding YAML at "
"runtime."
msgstr ""
"在 Admin 的 **Settings**、**Providers** 和 **Routing** 中配置网关。应用配置保存在 "
"PostgreSQL 中；网关在运行时不读取任何模型、路由、告警、发行版或品牌的 YAML 文件。"

