#: ../developer/configuration.md:17
msgid ""
"A fresh database has no provider or model. The console stays available "
"for first-run setup and shows **Ask admin to configure** until the "
"required configuration exists; users never see secret values or private "
"configuration paths. A provider key alone installs no example models; the"
" local tutorial (`make up DISTRIBUTION=example`) is a separate, opt-in "
"fixture."
msgstr ""
"新数据库中没有任何 provider 或模型。控制台仍可用于首次运行设置，并在所需配置齐全之前显示 **Ask admin to "
"configure**；用户永远看不到秘密值或私有的配置路径。只提供 provider 的 key 不会安装任何示例模型；本地教程（`make "
"up DISTRIBUTION=example`）是一个独立的、需要主动选择的测试环境。"

